# CROPSENSE — COMPLETE WEBSITE DEVELOPMENT MASTER PROMPT

## 1. PROJECT OVERVIEW

Build a complete, responsive, premium-quality agricultural intelligence web platform called **CropSense**.

**Brand name:** CropSense  
**Tagline:** Your Crop Health, Powered by AI.  
**Category:** AgriTech | Artificial Intelligence | Computer Vision | Predictive Analytics | Precision Agriculture

### Project objective

CropSense is an AI-powered predictive crop health monitoring platform designed to help farmers detect crop diseases early, monitor environmental conditions, analyze historical satellite imagery, predict disease risks, and receive personalized preventive and treatment recommendations.

The platform should combine AI-powered plant disease detection, environmental analysis, satellite-based historical monitoring, and a multilingual AI agricultural assistant.

The application should look like a professionally funded AgriTech startup, not a generic AI-generated dashboard or a basic hackathon prototype.

The entire website must have a consistent design language, smooth navigation, responsive layouts, realistic agricultural data visualizations, and working frontend interactions.

